   "type": "final",
   "speaker": "agent",
   "text": "\n\nI heard you say \"My brother will arrive early tomorrow morning.\"I noticed a small pronunciation issue with the \"r\" sound in \"brother.\" Let's focus on that. Please try saying just the word \"brother\" with a clear \"r\" sound at the end. Remember, in English, the \"r\" should be pronounced softly, almost like a slight vibration in the back of your mouth. Can you repeat the word \"brother\" for me?",
